<title>MALAYSIA: TA Enterprise 6-month net profit up.</title>
<headline>TA Enterprise 6-month net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     127.26	vs     117.55</p>
<p>    Shr     (cents)	 15.1	 vs	28.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		 460.53	vs     287.36</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 182.64	vs     171.84</p>
<p>    Minorities		 0.91	vs less  0.07</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)    5.0	 vs	 5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the company is TA Enterprise Bhd. It is mainly involved in stockbroking.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
